{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1SA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒母耳記上","commonName":"撒母耳記上","title":"撒母耳記上","order":9,"numberOfChapters":31,"sha256":"f02ff3b35936be045ff97ef9e375efb414e6aa2f73a58d4beb40f0d40023f047","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":31,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1SA/31.json","totalNumberOfVerses":808},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["掃羅之死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人與以色列人交戰，以色列人敗逃，許多人在基利波山被殺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人窮追掃羅及其眾子，殺了掃羅的兒子約拿單、亞比拿達和麥基舒亞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["掃羅周圍戰事激烈，他被弓箭手發現後射成重傷，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就對為他拿兵器的人說：「拔出你的刀來刺死我吧，免得那些未受割禮的人來刺殺和凌辱我。」但拿兵器的人非常害怕，不敢動手，掃羅就拿起刀來，伏刀自盡了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["拿兵器的人看見掃羅已死，也伏刀自盡了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那一天，掃羅和他三個兒子，以及為他拿兵器的人和他的軍隊都死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["平原一帶和約旦河對面的以色列人見以色列軍敗逃、掃羅及其眾子已死，都棄城而逃。於是，非利士人佔據了那些城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人來剝陣亡者的衣物，發現掃羅和他的三個兒子橫屍基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就割下掃羅的頭顱，剝下他的盔甲，並派人去非利士全境，在他們偶像的廟裡及民眾中通告消息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["非利士人把掃羅的盔甲放在亞斯她錄神廟裡，把他的屍體釘在伯·珊城牆上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列·雅比人聽見非利士人對掃羅的所作所為，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他們所有的勇士就連夜趕到伯·珊，從牆上取下掃羅和他兒子們的屍體，運到雅比火化，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["把骨灰葬在雅比的柳樹下，又為他們禁食了七天。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1SA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2SA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1SA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}